<!--
  Every page of the public website, and nothing else.

  Hand-written on purpose: ten pages that change when somebody decides they
  change, not a generated file that quietly starts listing a route somebody
  meant to keep behind the login. Add a page here when you add one to the
  router's public block, and `pnpm verify:site` will tell you if you forget.

  The addresses are the LIVE site's. A sitemap that lists dev would invite
  Google to index a second copy of the site full of test data.
-->
